                                          2469  #-----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                          2470  #
                                          2471  #  vCPU extension functions (for acceleration and compaction) follow below.
                                          2472  #
                                          2473  #  The naming convention is: SYS_<CamelCase>[_v<V>]_<N>
                                          2474  #
                                          2475  #  With <N> the maximum number of cycles the function will run
                                          2476  #  (counted from NEXT to NEXT). This is the same number that must
                                          2477  #  be passed to the 'SYS' vCPU instruction as operand, and it will
                                          2478  #  appear in the GCL code upon use.
                                          2479  #
                                          2480  #  If a SYS extension got introduced after ROM v1, the version number of
                                          2481  #  introduction is included in the name. This helps the programmer to be
                                          2482  #  reminded to verify the acutal ROM version and fail gracefully on older
                                          2483  #  ROMs than required. See also Docs/GT1-files.txt on using [romType].
                                          2484  #
                                          2485  #-----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                          2486
